{"seq":8,"slug":"crisis-communication","title":"危机沟通与公关","stage":"DONE","category":"negotiation-communication","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/negotiation-communication/crisis-communication","rating":{"composite":3.66,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# 危机沟通与公关\n\n当一个组织陷入危机，决定它存亡的往往不是事件本身有多严重，而是它如何沟通。同样一起数据泄露，有的公司因坦诚迅速的回应赢回了信任，有的公司因傲慢拖延的应对把小事拖成了灭顶之灾。危机沟通正是研究这门生死攸关技艺的学科：在公众最不信任你、时间最紧迫、信息最残缺的时刻，如何说对话、做对事、守住声誉。\n\n这个 hub 按一条完整的时间逻辑展开，四个章节对应危机管理的全生命周期，层层递进。\n\n第一章「危机沟通基础」打地基。它先定义什么是危机、有哪些类型、沿时间轴如何演化，再绘制四大沟通理论的谱系，最后讲清你究竟在对谁说话（利益相关者）以及手里握着多少信用本钱（声誉）。这一章回答的是「这是什么、为什么」，是后续所有策略的认识论前提。\n\n第二章「应对策略」是理论的工程化。它以情境危机沟通理论 SCCT 为引擎，把「该选什么策略」变成一套可推导的决策——先判危机责任，再匹配回应强度。在此之上，它深入剖解责任承担最重的动作「道歉」，并处理如何把策略打包成消息、投放到正确渠道。这一章回答「该说什么、怎么定策略」。\n\n第三章「实务流程」把策略落到地面。危机的胜负大半在爆发前已定，所以它从事前的准备与预案讲起，再到爆发期发言人如何在镜头与敌意前守住可信度，最后到社交媒体时代如何用监测做雷达、用实时互动打好这场被压缩到分钟级的战争。这一章回答「具体怎么执行」。\n\n第四章「恢复与学习」处理危机退场之后的长尾。声誉修复是一场以年计的愈合工程，靠行动而非话术；危机后评估把代价高昂的经历转化为组织能力；议题管理则把战线前推到危机发生之前，让最好的危机沟通成为那场从未发生的危机。这一章闭合了从危机后反馈回危机前的循环。\n\n四条主线如此递进：理解（基础）到决策（策略）到执行（实务）再到进化（恢复学习），最终回到起点形成闭环。读完整个 hub，你将获得的不是一套救火话术，而是一种把危机当作可识别、可准备、可应对、可学习的系统能力。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"foundations","title":"危机沟通基础","docCount":3,"url":"/h/negotiation-communication/crisis-communication/foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"crisis-types-lifecycle","title":"危机的类型与生命周期","url":"/h/negotiation-communication/crisis-communication/foundations/crisis-types-lifecycle"},{"seq":2,"slug":"crisis-comm-theory","title":"危机沟通理论","url":"/h/negotiation-communication/crisis-communication/foundations/crisis-comm-theory"},{"seq":3,"slug":"stakeholders-reputation","title":"利益相关者与声誉","url":"/h/negotiation-communication/crisis-communication/foundations/stakeholders-reputation"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"strategies","title":"应对策略","docCount":3,"url":"/h/negotiation-communication/crisis-communication/strategies","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"scct","title":"情境危机沟通理论 SCCT","url":"/h/negotiation-communication/crisis-communication/strategies/scct"},{"seq":2,"slug":"apology-responsibility","title":"道歉与责任承担","url":"/h/negotiation-communication/crisis-communication/strategies/apology-responsibility"},{"seq":3,"slug":"message-channel-strategy","title":"信息策略与渠道","url":"/h/negotiation-communication/crisis-communication/strategies/message-channel-strategy"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"practice","title":"实务流程","docCount":3,"url":"/h/negotiation-communication/crisis-communication/practice","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"crisis-preparedness","title":"危机准备与预案","url":"/h/negotiation-communication/crisis-communication/practice/crisis-preparedness"},{"seq":2,"slug":"crisis-spokesperson","title":"危机中的发言","url":"/h/negotiation-communication/crisis-communication/practice/crisis-spokesperson"},{"seq":3,"slug":"social-media-monitoring","title":"社交媒体与舆情","url":"/h/negotiation-communication/crisis-communication/practice/social-media-monitoring"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"recovery","title":"恢复与学习","docCount":3,"url":"/h/negotiation-communication/crisis-communication/recovery","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"reputation-repair","title":"声誉修复","url":"/h/negotiation-communication/crisis-communication/recovery/reputation-repair"},{"seq":2,"slug":"post-crisis-evaluation","title":"危机后评估","url":"/h/negotiation-communication/crisis-communication/recovery/post-crisis-evaluation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"issues-management","title":"议题管理与预防","url":"/h/negotiation-communication/crisis-communication/recovery/issues-management"}]}]}